The provenance manifests in Packages/EmulsionCore/Sources/EmulsionFit/Resources/StockData
describe this project's own numeric readings of charts published in Eastman Kodak Company
technical data sheets (H-1-5207, H-1-5219, H-1-2383): source document, revision, URL,
PDF SHA-256, figure, tracing method, error estimates and the SHA-256 of each traced curve
file. The traced curves themselves are not included in this repository. The fitted stock
files there (negative-fit.stock.json) hold film-model parameters fitted to those readings,
with provenance and residual statistics; they do not contain the traced curves. The data sheets
are copyright Eastman Kodak Company and are not redistributed here. The readings are used
only by the offline fitting tool and are not part of the apps. This project is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Kodak.
